  "fullDescription": "350 Comic Brushes for Procreate 5+ spanning across 11 brush sets to use in your artwork, designs, signs, advertisements, and more.\nCreate your comics and tell your story quicker and more efficiently than ever before. Don’t waste time getting worn down by the basics. Learn to draw with character and scene stamps and even incorporate the comic style into your existing work. The possibilities are limitless, for beginners just starting out and the pros looking to streamline their workflow.\n\nThe Ultimate Comic Artist Toolkit for Procreate 5+ includes:\n\n– 62 character stamps\n– 31 sound FX word stamps\n– 31 scene stamps\n– 27 distressed texture brushes\n– 26 line, hatching, shading, and sketching brushes\n– 11 comic panel stamps\n– 3 Comic FX brush sets (82 brushes total)\n– 2 Misc. comic stamp sets (80 brushes total)",
